4	 * Source of truth: `superset-companion/PROTOCOL.md`, protocol 1 / envelope v1.
5	 * Where this file and PROTOCOL.md disagree, PROTOCOL.md wins and this file is
6	 * the bug. Every other module in this directory imports its shapes from here;
7	 * nothing re-declares a wire type locally.
8	 *
9	 * Conventions carried over from the document and enforced here by typing:
10	 *  - all times are integer milliseconds since the Unix epoch, field names end `Ms`
11	 *  - all binary-in-JSON is base64url WITHOUT padding
12	 *  - every enum has an `"unknown"` member; unknown values degrade, never throw
13	 *  - there are no optional-with-default fields: a missing required field is a
14	 *    hard error (`bad_request` / `envelope_invalid`), never defaulted
15	 */
16	
